<h2 id="bottom-line">Bottom Line</h2>

<p>Instapaper pre-installed on the BOOX Palma 2 and Palma 2 Pro is one of those quiet ecosystem moves that changes the day-to-day for a specific kind of reader: people who save articles all week and read them on a screen that does not glare, does not ping, and does not try to sell them anything. The app brings sync, offline reading, highlights, and notes to a device that was already the best pocket E Ink reader money can buy.</p>

<p>If you read a lot of long-form web content, the combination is hard to beat — and it is a genuine alternative to the increasingly paywalled Kindle pipeline. Keep the <a href="https://www.instapaper.com" rel="noopener" target="_blank">official Instapaper service</a> as your source of truth for features, follow the <a href="https://goodereader.com/blog/onyx-boox/instapaper-now-comes-pre-installed-on-boox-devices" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Good e-Reader announcement</a> for the device details, and keep your EPUB archive in Calibre so your reading is never held hostage by any single service.</p>
